app, which is available for a purchase price of $2.99, and includes additional in-app purchases.\n\nAbout The Wonder Weeks\n\nCategory\n\nHealth & Fitness\n\nIn-App Purchases\n\nyes\n\nRating\n\nEveryone\n\n## What is The Wonder Weeks?\n\nWith The Wonder Weeks, parents are able to get a timely glimpse of the stages of development their little ones are going through, as well as suggestions for developmentally appropriate play activities they can engage them in.\n\nMany new parents are stumped when their baby enters into a fussy period, or a period of eager eating/loss of appetite, and The Wonder Weeks is an app that attempts to help parents understand the correlations between their baby’s behavior and mental development.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Wonder Weeks - 神奇的飞跃周 | AppFollow | App’s reputation platform (https://apps.appfollow.io/ios/the-wonder-weeks-shen-qi-de-fei-yue-zhou/529815782?country=cn)\nciteturn86search4 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; \n\nFeb 22, 2019\n\n关于这个应用就是骗人的，付了钱还需要花40块钱再解锁全部功能，比买本书都贵，真不值得花钱买这个应用\n\nask user to change the rating\n\nImage: ?\n\nLingLingZou\n\nAug 18, 2019\n\n为什么里面的视频总是看不到？\n\nDeveloper replied on Aug 19, 2019\n\nHi, inability to see the videos is connected with your geolocation, precisely Vimeo services being often banned or restricted in China. Our videos are streamed on that platform. Hopefully these issues are resolved in the near future. Best, Marco\n\nask user to change the rating\n\nImage: ?\n\ndandanleebombbomb\n\nAug 31, 2019\n\nWhat you pay for downloading this app is just a freaking calendar and a note function??! And if you want to know about what are those leaps you need to pay to unlock each leap?! Really? Please do not waste your money!\n\nDeveloper replied on Sep 03, 2019\n\nHi, yes, we do offer option for in-app purchases, for those readers who want to read more, but those purchases are purely optional. -----------------